onclick=\"bcv(10,6,1)\">2Sam 6:1</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> <highlight>test, try</highlight> (Aramaic = <bdbheb>בחן</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>בְּחַרְתִּיךָ בְּכוּר עֹ֑נִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 48:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,10)\">Isa 48:10</ref> <highlight>I have tested thee in the furnace of affliction</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>, but <highlight>chosen</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> Rab <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Calv')\">Calv</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup>. <highlight>Niph`al</highlight> <bdbheb>נִבְחַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,3)\">Jer 8:3</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נִבְחָר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,10)\">Prov 8:10</ref> + 5 t.; — <highlight>to be chosen</highlight>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> absolute <highlight>chosen, choice</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,10)\">Prov 8:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,19)\">Prov 8:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 10:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,20)\">Prov 10:20</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> construct <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>וְנִבְחַר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מות מחיים</bdbheb> <highlight>death will be chosen rather than life</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,3)\">Jer 8:3</ref> <highlight>choicer than</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,16)\">Prov 16:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 22:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,1)\">Prov 22:1</ref> <bdbheb>נבחר ליהוה מזבח</bdbheb> <highlight>choicer</highlight> (more acceptable) <highlight>to Yahweh</highlight> than peace-offering <ref ref=\"Prov 21:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,3)\">Prov 21:3</ref>. <b>Pu`al</b> <bdbheb>יְבֻחַר</bdbheb> <highlight>chosen, selected</highlight> <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,4)\">Eccl 9:4</ref> (<bdbheb>יְחֻבַּר</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 7:6", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 7, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 41:24", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Job 29:25", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 29, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Exod 17:9", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "1Sam 2:28", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Isa 7:15", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Isa 7:16", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezek 20:5", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 20, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Sam 20:30", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 20, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Zech 3:2", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 3, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Exod 14:7", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Neh 9:7", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Deut 7:7", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 7, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 44:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Deut 14:2", "book": "DEU", "c